# Never committed: personal data. KUE's memory lives in
# ~/Library/Application Support/Lantern, outside the repository — these patterns
# are for a copy that ends up here by accident (an export, a test left behind).
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
KILLED

# Never committed: recordings. KUE records no audio; a file like this in the
# repository would be a measurement clip or a mistake, and neither belongs here.
*.wav
*.m4a
*.caf
*.aiff
*.aif
*.mp3
*.flac
*.log
